H2b' Call the find of the map directly, with a pair {pointer, type index} and a switch. Against include/ of 6c50679 (H1' and the results in registers are in it); apply with git apply -p1 in the directory that holds include/.
direct.hpp walks the closed set of types that the data type reaches (as H2a); a value is {const void *p; size_t index}, absent is p == nullptr, told by value_is_absent; every operation is a switch over the index with the code of each type inline; no function pointer and no std::visit. A type outside the closed set does not compile (static_assert); a data type that the walk cannot reach (a struct) is rendered through Table as before.

